Package: KASPtools
Type: Package
Title: KASP and KASP-Like Genotyping Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.com")
Description: Imports KASP and KASP-like fluorescence data from DT96 RDML/XML
    and QuantStudio XLSX exports, visualizes fluorescence kinetics, performs
    plateau-corrected allelic discrimination with control-guided empirical
    clustering, and exports genotype calls and diagnostic results.
